    "note": "The Forest Service Pollock Trailhead page (last updated May 28, 2026) shows no featured alerts and no closure for the trailhead itself. Its 'temporarily closed until further notice' line is the New Meadows Ranger District office hours, not the trailhead. Season June-October, depending on snow levels. No separate closure notice for the tower was found."
